      "content": "That makes sense, thanks for clarifying the self-ownership angle. Now, could you do the same for the social democratic side? I want to make sure the \"collective responsibility\" part is just as philosophically deep. Instead of just saying it's about \"social justice,\" could you break down the actual moral logic they use to justify wealth redistribution? Like, what are the specific ethical frameworks—maybe something regarding distributive justice or social contract theory—that they use to argue that the community has a legitimate moral claim on individual resources?",
